WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
A phone wakes to a warm sunrise. Your day, already styled.

00:03.000 --> 00:08.000
Noor suggests the leopard set for a warm, dry morning.

00:08.000 --> 00:13.000
The complete look appears, with boots, a studded bag, and outfit actions.

00:13.000 --> 00:18.000
The outfit opens. Every piece is already considered.

00:18.000 --> 00:23.000
A wardrobe grid shows the pieces you already own.

00:23.000 --> 00:26.000
Wear today. Your outfit is ready.

00:26.000 --> 00:28.000
Wearing it. Noor is already thinking about tomorrow.

00:28.000 --> 00:30.000
Morrow Studio. Your day, already styled.
